{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"4614ed94-f998-43aa-b92a-6d64901dc73d","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the full problem space. Let me extract Q6.4's details:\n\n**Q6.4**: NoC（Network-on-Chip）与片上互连架构如何设计以支持MoE（expert间全对全通信）、DiT（去噪步骤间数据传递）、多模态（多编码器输出汇聚）、Video（时空特征跨计算单元传递）在多算子/微算子并发下的高效数据流与通信？拓扑结构（Mesh、Torus、Tree、Butterfly）、路由策略、流控机制如何影响并发性能？\n\n**预关键词**: Network-on-Chip / 片上网络, NoC topology / NoC拓扑, mesh/torus/tree/butterfly / 网格/环网/树/蝶形, routing algorithm / 路由算法, flow control / 流控, all-to-all communication / 全对全通信, dataflow architecture / 数据流架构, systolic array interconnect / 脉动阵列互连, on-chip bandwidth / 片上带宽, spatial architecture / 空间架构, NVIDIA NVLink/NVSwitch, Tesla Dojo NoC\n\n**侧重点**: 硬件体系结构 → 输出节顺序: 方法细节（数据流/架构/运行时调度）→ 实验环境 → 实现(aux) → 是什么？(aux) → 方法对比表\n\nNow let me plan the logical chain decomposition:\n\nS1: NoC topology (Mesh/Torus/Tree/Butterfly) - 核心机制/拓扑结构\nS2: Routing strategy & flow control - 路由策略/流控机制\nS3: All-to-all communication for MoE - MoE expert间全对全通信\nS4: Data passing between denoising steps for DiT - DiT去噪步骤间数据传递\nS5: Multi-encoder output aggregation for multimodal - 多模态多编码器输出汇聚\nS6: Spatiotemporal feature transfer for Video - Video时空特征跨计算单元传递\nS7: How topology/routing/flow control affect concurrency performance - 拓扑/路由/流控对并发性能的影响\n\nNow I need to execute the four-directory search for each chain node. Let me start with the searches.","signature":"4614ed94-f998-43aa-b92a-6d64901dc73d"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":20646,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":28032,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9022b13a-f534-46e0-975c-ed63ef64f9c3","uuid":"73e7e975-1abd-4a18-9bc3-2868da67718d"}
