{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_00_RYWuNloXMYsphq8s8Uqo4673","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":{\"mode\":\"omnisearch\",\"hits\":[{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Systolic-array Accelerator (for VLM Inference).md\",\"basename\":\"Systolic-array Accelerator (for VLM Inference)\",\"score\":5323.068884463975,\"foundWords\":[\"dataflow\",\"dataflow的32×32\",\"dataflow（weights预加载到pe中，inputs和outputs流经array）。gemm以tile方式执行：输入tile\",\"architecture\",\"pe\",\"pe数量\",\"array\",\"array配置为32×32\",\"array是一种通过2d\",\"array的gemm\",\"array、fp16\",\"array和所有baseline\",\"array，每个pe执行fp16\",\"systolic\",\"systolic-array\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Systolic-array\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Systolic-array\",\"offset\":56},{\"match\":\"dataflow的32×32\",\"offset\":147},{\"match\":\"PE\",\"offset\":162},{\"match\":\"array，每个PE执行FP16\",\"offset\":165},{\"match\":\"Systolic\",\"offset\":231},{\"match\":\"Array是一种通过2D\",\"offset\":240},{\"match\":\"PE\",\"offset\":253},{\"match\":\"systolic\",\"offset\":327},{\"match\":\"array配置为32×32\",\"offset\":336},{\"match\":\"PE\",\"offset\":350},{\"match\":\"array、FP16\",\"offset\":353},{\"match\":\"dataflow（weights预加载到PE中，inputs和outputs流经array）。GEMM以tile方式执行：输入tile\",\"offset\":407},{\"match\":\"array\",\"offset\":586},{\"match\":\"systolic\",\"offset\":692},{\"match\":\"array的GEMM\",\"offset\":701},{\"match\":\"PE\",\"offset\":1039},{\"match\":\"systolic\",\"offset\":1196},{\"match\":\"array和所有baseline\",\"offset\":1205},{\"match\":\"PE数量\",\"offset\":1320},{\"match\":\"Architecture\",\"offset\":1537}],\"excerpt\":\"## Systolic-array Accelerator (for VLM Inference)\\n术语解释\\nSystolic-array Accelerator是Focus论文的baseline计算架构，也是Focus Unit所嵌入的宿主加速器。它采用weight stationary dataflow的32×32 PE array，每个PE执行FP16 multiply和FP32 accumulate。\\n术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nSystolic Array是一种通过2D PE grid做rhythmic data movement完成矩阵乘法的硬件架构，广泛应用于Goo…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Focus Unit.md\",\"basename\":\"F